        "@value": "Venues:  The Rockwater Bar &amp; Grill featuring:     Amy Nelson: 9:45-10:30    The Denim Daddies: 10:45-11:30    Kitty and the Rooster: 12:00 - 12:45    Whitetooth Brewery featuring:    Oh November: 8:45-9:30    Colin Shields: 10:00-10:45    The Bar featuring:    Tea Fannie: 10:00-10:45    Brain Bent: 11:00-11:45    K-RIZ and the Family: 12:00-12:45    Golden Civic Centre (all ages) featuring:    Ricky Diamonds: 9:30-10:15    Kayla and the Yacht Daddies: 10:30-11:15  Ticket Information:  To enjoy the incredible musical performances on Saturday Feb 21, tickets must be purchased in advance. All venues except for the Golden Civic Centre are 19+. Wristband grants you access to all venues!    Early Bird Members $25.00  Members Ticket $30.00  General Admission $35.00  Youth $5.00 | will be given special coloured wristbands**  The Golden Civic Centre is an all-ages, family-friendly venue    Wristband Pick-Up Details    Art Gallery of Golden (AGOG)  Pick up your wristbands February 14th–21st  Monday–Saturday | 10:30 AM–5:00 PM    Festival Day Pick-Up – Saturday, Feb 21st  Festival passes available for purchase at The Rockwater and the Golden Civic Centre starting at 9:30 PM.  Wristbands can also be picked up at both locations from 9:30 PM onward.    Important Information!      The Rockwater, The Bar &amp; Whitetooth Brewery are 19+    We do not offer refunds    If you lose your wristband band we cannot offer you a replacement. Please keep them safe or pick them up on Feb 21st!  "
      }
    ],
