        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Gather with neighbours, friends, and family for a joyful community choir workshop that invites every voice—confident or shy, trained or brand new—to rise together. Guided by two of our talented local musicians, this workshop will explore harmony, rhythm, and communal breath to create a choir performance for the EmberFest pageant."
      }
