    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "      In true Emberfest fashion, the workshop is playful, accessible, and infused with grassroots creativity. Together, we’ll sing songs that uplift, connect, and imagine futures shaped by collaboration and hope. No prior singing experience is needed—just curiosity and a willingness to add your voice to the collective.    Drop in entry! No registration is required.    Donations are appreciated and go towards KHC programming.      Practice for the choir on Saturday, Feb 21st:    Choir Version of Lean on Me    "
      }
