        "@value": "EmberFest Story Night at Four Points Books | Kicking Horse Culture"
      }
    ],
    "https://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Step into an evening of cozy ambiance, warm drinks, and shared imagination as our community gathers for a Positive Futurisms–themed Open Mic Storytelling Night. Hosted at Four Points Books, folks of all ages are invited to share stories and poetry —real, imagined, future-dreamed, or yet-to-be-invented."
      }
    ],
