        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "What could Golden look like in the years ahead? Community Futures Day invites residents of all ages to come together for an interactive, ideas-driven gathering focused on imagining Golden’s future.    As part of EmberFest 2026, this lively, facilitated session brings community members together with local leaders, creatives, and youth for meaningful conversation and shared dreaming. Small-group table discussions will spark ideas around community life, culture, environment, and connection, with artists capturing key themes and ideas as they emerge.    The event is designed to be welcoming, social, and hopeful, a chance to meet new people, share perspectives, and contribute to a collective vision for Golden. The ideas gathered will be documented and shared to help inform future community planning and creative projects.    Please RSVP!!    Donations are appreciated and go towards KHC programming."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "EmberFest Community Futures Day"
      }
    ],
