        "@value": "Get groovy with local dancer and choreographer Chelsea who will guide us through an empowering movement practice on the eve of the EmberFest pageant. This event is for Adults! All levels are welcome to come and groove! FREE EVENT! NO REGISTRATION REQUIRED!"
