    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://kickinghorseculture.ca/wp-content/uploads/0D3A9358-edit-scaled.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://kickinghorseculture.ca/events/sexy-sneakers-dance/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://kickinghorseculture.ca/events/sexy-sneakers-dance/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/performer": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "      Sexy Sneakers is a style of dance that taps into our femininity and sensuality, it uses a fusion of street dance foundations with a focus on empowerment and boldness in self-expression. Fierce, powerful, and energetic, this saucy style will bring out your inner Beyonce, J-Lo, and Lady Gaga!      About the Artist  Chelsea Friedman is a dancer, choreographer, and educator known for her dynamic movement style and her ability to create welcoming, empowering spaces for all dancers. She has spent several years teaching in the Sea to Sky region, including Squamish and Vancouver, and is now based in Golden, BC, where she shares her love of movement and continues to build community through dance.      Chelsea’s teaching philosophy centres around safety, inclusivity, and growth. She prides herself on cultivating supportive environments where dancers of all levels can learn, take risks, and explore movement without judgment. Her classes blend musicality, strength, and storytelling—encouraging dancers to access confidence, power, and connection through dance      Drop in entry! No registration is required.    Donations are appreciated and go towards KHC programming.    "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "EmberFest Sexy Sneakers Dance Workshop"
      }
    ],
