    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "      Chords and lyrics will be provided so everyone can jump in, whether you’re strumming, fiddling, tapping along, or finding your voice. This workshop celebrates the magic of communal music-making: spontaneity, laughter, shared sound, and the joy that emerges when neighbours come together to play.      Drop in entry! No registration is required.    Donations are appreciated and go towards KHC programming.    "
