      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "      The Civic Centre will be transformed into a country-inspired dance hall! Local musicians will take the stage with a live backing band. This Grand Ole Opry-style event invites festival-goers of all ages and abilities to kick up their heels, spin, clap, and connect through rhythm.    In keeping with Emberfest’s spirit of community creativity, grassroots performance, and low-tech magic, this gathering is a celebration of the music, movement, and joy that happens when a town comes together to make its own entertainment. Whether you’re a seasoned line dancer, a toe-tapping beginner, or a curious festival wanderer, there’s a place for you on the dance floor.    Tickets are $15.00 in advance, $20.00 at the door.    Doors 7:00 | Show: 7:30    Check out the Golden Light Horse Club Skijoring event during the day then come boot skoot'n boogie into the night!      "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "EmberFest Grand Ole Opry"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventAttendanceMode": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode"
      }
    ]
  },
