        "@value": "Film Kicks presents Sentimental Value | Kicking Horse Culture"
      }
    ],
    "https://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Despite its title, the great strength of this eloquent family drama is its heartfelt but unsentimental tone as it explores the complex dynamics between a father who is a brilliant film director and the two grown daughters he tries, quite belatedly, to form an emotional bond with."
      }
    ],
