        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Golden's wildly successful Christmas Craft Faire will be back again this year on Nov. 21st, 22nd, and 23rd at Mt. 7 Rec Plex. For decades now, the Christmas Craft Faire is the kickoff to the Christmas season and the social event of the month. With more than 60 artists, artisans, and crafters, the Craft faire is the spot to find all of your unique holiday goods. You'll find a variety of outstanding handmade goods at the Faire – ranging from one-of-a-kind jewelry, stationery, clothing and accessories to leather goods, art prints, ceramics, furnishings and much, much more. We attract vendors from all over Alberta and BC each year.    This year our market hours are adjusted so that everyone can find a time to drop by; enjoy our night market on Friday, all day shopping Saturday, or a festive Sunday morning peruse. Stay tuned for live music updates and a creative space!    Admission by donation.    Your admission donation supports KHC's ability to produce the Craft Faire each season ... for the benefit of our local and regional artisans and you  - our happy shoppers. Thanks!"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Christmas Craft Faire"
      }
    ],
