        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Who loves candles and good vibes? Join artist Jeanette Jackson for a fun and creative night at the Golden Youth Centre where we’ll be making our very own Intention Candles! Learn about nature's energies, the phases of the moon, setting intentions, and candle pouring."
