        "@value": "*Subtitles included in this film.    Our Film Kicks volunteer group coordinated by Mandy Cantle curates a season of film selections chosen to present the best of Canadian and International films at the Golden Cinema.     Advance tickets can be purchased online or in person at AGOG. Doors open at 7pm. Tickets are available at the door -- if not sold out.    Adult Member $10  Non-Member $12  Child and Youth (18 and under): $5     At the door: $12 + GST "
