        "@value": "KHC presents: Ayla Tesler-Mabé & The Parsons | Kicking Horse Culture"
      }
    ],
    "https://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The stage at Keith King Park welcomes a full line up on August 13th, with two headliners and a local tweener set! Ayla Tesler-Mabé is a 23-year-old songwriter, producer, educator, and musician. Beginning her musical journey on the cello, then bass, and eventually settling on guitar. Clayton & Joelle Parsons are old souls with a sound that transcends time. Their genuine country-roots style is reminiscent of the ‘60’s American folk revival scene that birthed Joan Baez, Emmylou Harris, Pete Seeger, and Peter, Paul & Mary. Featuring local talent: Oh November & Katie Kendall"
      }
    ],
