    ],
    "https://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Born in 1990 in Taipei, Taiwan, Shirley is a visual artist whose practice began with painting and expanded into sculpture and installation in 2025. She embarked on a life journey shaped by a deep curiosity about the world's diversity and interconnectedness. Shirley's artistic philosophy revolves around stimulating introspection and dialogue. It does not seek to provide definitive answers but rather to provoke thought on the nuances of perception."
