        "@value": "Ian St. Arnaud's new album, Love and the Front Lawn, continues his characteristic sad lyrics/happy melodies framework but with a new instrumental palette. St. Arnaud has performed with Basia Bulat, Reuben and the Dark, and Lucy Rose among countless others and has performed at stages across the world. Featuring local talent: Jumping Rodents"
