    "http://schema.org/performer": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "      Looking for weekend fun?      Every Weekend Starting Jan 18 (Jan 18-19, Jan 25-26, Feb 1-2, Feb 8-9)     Free- 1:00 - 8:00 p.m.    Join us for Play House Open Houses, a series of free art making sessions to create costumes, puppets, lanterns and more!    These après-ski creative sessions are the perfect way to unwind, connect, and get inspired after a day enjoying nature. These open house sessions are for all ages. All materials provided but you are welcome to bring your own!      Join us for Play House Open Houses, a series of free community workshops kicking off this January! These après-ski creative sessions are the perfect way to unwind, connect, and get inspired after a day enjoying nature. Whether you’re a seasoned artist or just looking to try something new, these drop-in sessions offer something for everyone. Everything made at these sessions can be incorporated into our magical night on Feb 15th, EmberFest!    ???? What to Expect:      Hands-on art activities led by local artists.    A welcoming environment for all ages and skill levels.    Opportunities to explore new creative mediums and contribute to something bigger.    Opportunity to meet other community members and create something special for EmberFest!    ✨ Why Join?      It’s FREE and open to everyone!    All creativity created during these sessions will be incorporated into EmberFest, making your art a part of this beloved community event.    Celebrate community connection while discovering the joy of artistic expression in a fun and relaxed setting.    Bring your friends, family, or just yourself, and experience the magic of Play House. No registration is needed—just drop in and join the fun! Together, we’ll create something truly unforgettable for EmberFest.        Location  Golden Civic Centre, V0A1H2"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "EmberFest- PlayHouse Free Drop in Creative sessions"
      }
    ],
