        "@language": "en",
        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Our Film Kicks volunteer group coordinated by Mandy Cantle curates a season of film selections chosen to present the best of Canadian and International films at the Golden Cinema. Here's our Fall line-up!    Advance tickets can be purchased online or in person at AGOG. Doors open at 7pm. Tickets are available at the door -- if not sold out.    Adult Member $10  Non-Member $12  Child and Youth (18 and under): $5     At the door: $12 + GST     Jan 30  Crossing    \"A beautiful film. Realistic and engaging\"  A heartfelt portrayal of overcoming the degrees of separation that divide us.  Achingly beautiful. The story will break your heart.    Feb 13  Anora                                  Electrifying, passionate and frantic  Romantic comedy drama  Absolutely compelling, entertaining and satisfying chaos.  It keeps you locked in  wanting to see what will happen next.    Feb 27  The Outrun                       Poignant, atmospheric and suspenseful  Starring Saoirse Ronan    March 06  All We Imagine As Light Winner of the Grand Prix at Cannes  Exquisitely beautiful and heartfelt  Heartfelt, bold, striking  A poetic story of disconnection and the human need for love, belonging and  connection."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Film Kicks presents Crossing"
      }
    ],
