    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "    ???? EmberFest Old-Time Jam ????    Date: February 1, 2025  Time: 6:00–8:00 PM  Location: Golden Civic Centre    Join us for an evening of music, connection, and community at the EmberFest Old-Time Jam! This free workshop is open to everyone, whether you’re a seasoned player or just starting your musical journey.    What to Expect:      A 30-minute intro session to guide you through how a jam works.    Chords and lyrics provided to help everyone join in.    A welcoming environment to play tunes, share music, and have fun.    All levels are welcome! A basic understanding of your instrument will help you participate fully, but the focus is on connection and enjoying the joy of making music together.    Come ignite your inner musician and celebrate the magic of community through song!      Location  Golden Civic Centre, V0A1H2"
      }
    ],
