        "@id": "https://kickinghorseculture.ca/events/emberfest/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/performer": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Exciting changes are here! Introducing EmberFest    Formerly known as the Snow King’s Masque Parade, our festival has evolved into EmberFest—a celebration of creativity, community, and connection. Join us on February 15, 2025 as we gather around the bonfire to share stories, skits, and artistic creations that reflect the spirit of our community. This year we are expanding the festival to include live music. 8 Bands will take to the stage following the fireworks and play into the wee hours of the morning.    This is grassroots, Volunteer Lead, event showcases a wide range of hands-on artistic activities and attracting the widest possible audience – the whole community! Over a period of weeks, professional and community-based artists work in collaboration with folks in the community – both young and old and everyone in between – to create a large-scale outdoor ‘pageant’ performed with more than 1000 folks in Golden’s Spirit Square. Together, we make low tech magic.    ????️ Tickets Required for Musical Acts  To enjoy the incredible musical performances at this year’s EmberFest, tickets must be purchased in advance. Venues are 19+, and your ticket grants access to some of Golden’s best live music.    Wristband Pick-Up Details:      Pick up your wristbands at the Art Gallery of Golden (AGOG) from February 1-15. Monday- Saturday, 10:30 - 5:00.     Don’t wait—secure your spot and join us for an unforgettable lineup of artists!    ???? Free Community Events at Spirit Square  For all-ages fun, head to Spirit Square for free community events and festivities around the bonfire.    Let’s celebrate EmberFest together—secure your tickets and get ready for a magical experience!"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "EmberFest"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventAttendanceMode": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode"
      }
    ]
  },
