    "http://schema.org/performer": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "      Experience the joy of singing in a group at our Free Choir Workshop, where no prior experience is necessary! Whether you’re a seasoned vocalist or just someone who loves to sing in the shower, this workshop is for you.    Under the guidance of a passionate choir leader, you’ll learn one uplifting song together, with an invitation to perform it at EmberFest as part of a special community song. This is a unique opportunity to be part of the festival’s magic and share your voice with others.    ???? What to Expect:      Fun and easy-to-follow vocal warm-ups.    Step-by-step guidance to learn a simple, beautiful song.    A welcoming environment to explore your voice and enjoy the power of harmony.    ???? Why Join?      No experience is required—just bring your enthusiasm!    Experience the transformative power of a unified voice.    Connect with others through the universal language of music and be part of EmberFest’s community celebration.    Come as you are, and leave feeling inspired, empowered, and ready to share your voice with the world. Let’s raise our voices together!    Join us at 4:00pm for pizza and vocal warmups!        Location  Golden Civic Centre, V0A1H2"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
