        "@value": "Step into a world of wonder and play at Circus After Dark, an evening workshop designed for adults to explore juggling, props, clowning, and character creation. Unleash your creativity, connect with others, and experience the joy of circus arts in a relaxed and fun environment. No experience required—just bring your sense of adventure!"
