        "@id": "https://kickinghorseculture.ca/wp-content/uploads/khc-emberfest-masque-parade-42-e1733521315953.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://kickinghorseculture.ca/events/emberfest-after-dark-adults-circus/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://kickinghorseculture.ca/events/emberfest-after-dark-adults-circus/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/performer": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "      Step into the ring and unleash your inner performer at Circus After Dark, a dynamic and immersive workshop designed for adults to explore the thrill of circus arts in a fun and supportive atmosphere.    Registration Required- Free**    ???? What to Expect:      Playful Connection: Rediscover the joy of play, connect with others, and let go of the ordinary for an evening filled with laughter and creativity.    Juggling &amp; Props: Learn to toss, spin, and flow with a variety of props, including juggling balls, poi, and fans.    Clowning Around: Embrace the art of comedy through playful character development and light-hearted improvisation.    Character Exploration: Bring your unique personality to life in the circus ring through guided character creation and storytelling.    Whether you’re a curious beginner or someone looking to reconnect with your playful side, this workshop offers something for everyone. No experience is necessary—just bring your enthusiasm and a willingness to try something new!    Date: Saturday, January 25  Time: 5:00 - 8:00 pm  Location: Golden Civic Centre  Ages: 18+    Join us for a night of creativity, connection, and circus magic under the stars. Let the fun begin!    Spaces are limited—reserve your spot today!        Location  Golden Civic Centre, V0A1H2"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "EmberFest- After Dark Adults Circus"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
