      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "      Step Right Up! Let the Fun Begin!    Registration Required** Free.      Join us for an action-packed day of circus adventure where kids can unleash their creativity and discover the magic of movement and play!    ???? Activities Include:      Juggling Fun: Learn to toss and catch like a pro! Master the basics of juggling with colorful balls, scarves, and more.    Poi Twirling &amp; Fans: Spin, swirl, and twirl with poi and fans as we explore mesmerizing movements and patterns.    Character Creation: Who will you be in the circus today? A daring acrobat? A mischievous clown? Dive into character development and bring your circus persona to life!    The Art of PLAY: Laugh, explore, and let your imagination soar through games and interactive activities that celebrate creativity and teamwork.    This workshop is all about building confidence, having fun, and learning new skills in a safe and supportive environment. No experience is necessary—just bring your energy, curiosity, and love for adventure!    Date: January 25th  Time: 1:00 pm - 4:00 pm  Location: Golden Civic Centre  Ages: Kids ages 5+    Get ready to juggle, twirl, and play your way into a circus dream!        Location  Golden Civic Centre, V0A1H2"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "EmberFest- Circus Day with Jocelyn and Sarah"
      }
    ],
