    "https://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The Good Lovelies – a.k.a. Caroline Brooks, Kerri Ough, and Sue Passmore – are one of Canada’s finest vocal trios. Although folk/country at heart, the Good Lovelies incorporate elements of pop, roots, and jazz into their award-winning sound."
