    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://kickinghorseculture.ca/wp-content/uploads/PSX_20240625_105120-scaled.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://kickinghorseculture.ca/events/robin-allingham_whispers-of-our-world/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://kickinghorseculture.ca/events/robin-allingham_whispers-of-our-world/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/performer": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "We are very pleased to welcome Robin Allingham: Whispers of our World  August 9- September 7, 2024  Artist Opening Reception August 9, 5:00 - 7:00 pm. Conversation and Q &amp; A with Artist.   Robin Allingham is a passionate photographer specializing in landscape photography. Based in Golden BC, she captures moments that tell compelling nature stories through her lens. Born with a love for the mountains, Robin enjoys living in the heart of Columbia Valley, spending time in the mountains hiking, skiing and mountain biking.  After an initial visit to Lake O’Hara, Robin knew that she needed to return to this special place. With a borrowed camera, she joined an organized photo expedition and her long-time love of nature met her new passion of photography. Robin purchased her first camera and, continuing to develop her photography skills, built a career based on her love of being in nature.  Driven by excitement and deep appreciation for the art of seeing, she is constantly exploring new places to refine her art. Every click of the shutter is an opportunity to freeze time and preserve beautiful moments. Robin’s portfolio showcases her keen eye for detail and the ability to evoke emotions through photographs. Robin’s enjoyment of the natural world extends to the wonder and beauty of her garden, which, in turn, leads to her joy of cooking. With her camera always at hand, Robin finds excitement every day; anticipating what she will find today, what beauty will reveal itself?"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "AGOG presents Robin Allingham: Whispers of our World"
      }
    ],
