    "http://schema.org/performer": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Anyone interested in hearing passionate prairie music should definitely check out Munro &amp; Patrick. These two veteran Saskatchewan stars got together six years ago and have been wowing the crowds ever since. With a righteous blend of country, blues, and soul, Heidi Munro and Scott Patrick offer an enticing, high-energy show combining classic cover songs with gritty, well-crafted originals.     Between the two of them, these gifted performers have won about a dozen SCMAs (Saskatchewan Country Music Awards), with Heidi being further honoured with a National Much Music Vocal prize. The equally accomplished Scott, a singer/songwriter and, particularly, guitarist, was a key member of renowned country-rock band Wyatt, and has played all across the country – including with such luminaries as Rascal Flatts and Kenny Rogers. This prairie “power couple” is the real deal.    Featuring Local talent: Jumping Rodents"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Munro &#038; Patrick"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventAttendanceMode": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode"
      }
    ]
  },
