    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Travis Pickering was born and raised in Golden, and this rising country star will get a hero’s reception when he returns here as a Summer Kicks headliner. “This town has been incredibly supportive from the start . . . you only get one hometown, and I’m always proud to say that Golden is mine,” declares this multiple award-winning singer-songwriter.     Inspired by artists such as Johnny Cash and Don Henley, Pickering delivers a soulful blend of neo-traditional country and alt-rock that’s made him a fan favourite throughout B.C. and Alberta. Check out his new album This Is Where I Stand, and then prepare to experience something deeply authentic and exciting when the five-piece Travis Pickering &amp; the Good Ol’ Boys take to the stage. “I really want to make music that you can sink your teeth into,” he grins.    Featuring Local tallent: Noise Pollution"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Travis Pickering &#038; the Good Ol’ Boys"
      }
