        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Our Film Kicks volunteer group coordinated by Mandy Cantle curates a season of film selections chosen to present the best of Canadian and International films at the Golden Cinema. Here's our winter line-up!    Advance tickets can be purchased at AGOG or call 250 344-6186. Doors open at 7pm. Tickets available at the door -- if not sold out.  January 18: Stop Making Sense  Considered by critics as the greatest concert film of all time, the live performance was shot over the course of three nights at Hollywood's Pantages Theater in December of 1983 and features Talking Heads' most memorable songs.  Tomatometer 100%  More on Rotten Tomatoes  February 1: Nyad  The remarkable true story of athlete Diana Nyad who, at the age of 60 and with the help of her best friend and coach, commits to achieving her life-long dream: a 110-mile open ocean swim from Cuba to Florida.  Tomatometer 89%  More on Rotten Tomatoes  February 22: Anatomy of a Fall  A woman is suspected of her husband's murder, and their blind son faces a moral dilemma as the main witness.  Tomatometer 96%  More on Rotten Tomatoes  March 7: The Quiet Girl  Rural Ireland 1981. A quiet, neglected girl is sent away from her dysfunctional family to live with foster parents for the summer. She blossoms in their care, but in this house where there are meant to be no secrets, she discovers one.  Tomatometer 97%  More on Rotten Tomatoes  March 21: American Fiction  A novelist who's fed up with the establishment profiting from \"Black\" entertainment uses a pen name to write a book that propels him into the heart of hypocrisy and the madness he claims to disdain.  Tomatometer 97%  More on Rotten Tomatoes"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Film Kicks presents Anatomy of a Fall"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventAttendanceMode": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode"
      }
    ]
  },
