    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Our Annual General Meeting will be held in person at the Civic Centre. Please gather around 5pm; the meeting will start promptly at 5:15pm MTN time. This AGM reviews our June 1, 2022 through May 31, 2023 fiscal year.    Documents coming soon as they are finalized.    June 2022 / May 2023 AGM Agenda Nov 15/2023: GDAC-KHC 2023-11-15 AGM Meeting Agenda    June 2022 / May 2023 GDAC Financials: KHC-GDAC 2022-2023 Cox &amp; Co Financial Statements    June 2021 / May 2022 AGM Minutes Nov 22/2022: KHC-GDAC-2022-11-22 AGM Meeting Minutes-FINAL    June 2022 / May 2023 AGM Chair's Annual Report: 22:23 Chair’s Report - AGM November 15, 2023    June 2022 / May 2023 Annual Report of Programs &amp; Operations    Passionate about governance and leadership? Consider joining the KHC Board of Directors.  Learn more here: KHC Board Recruitment Info 11-2022        June 2022 / May 2023 - Nov 15/2023 AGM MEETING MINUTES:    Thanks,  Kris King (Chair), Katie Hodder, Lyuba Kirkova, Darlene Whiting, Tracey Buckley."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "GDAC / KHC Annual General Meeting Nov 15, 2023"
      }
    ],
