        "@language": "en",
        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In her directorial debut, Celine Song brings to life 'Past Lives,' a poignant American romantic drama released in 2023. Starring the talented trio of Greta Lee, Teo Yoo, and John Magaro, the film delves into the enduring connection between childhood friends as they navigate the ebb and flow of their lives over a span of 24 years. As they evolve separately, the film explores the complexities of their relationship.    Drawing inspiration from her own life experiences, Celine Song weaves a semi-autobiographical narrative that touches on genuine events close to her heart.    'Past Lives' made its grand debut at the prestigious Sundance Film Festival on January 21, 2023, before gracing theaters across the United States on June 2, 2023. The film has garnered widespread critical acclaim, with accolades pouring in for Song's masterful storytelling, direction, striking visual aesthetics, and the stellar performances of Lee, Yoo, and Magaro."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Film Kicks presents Past Lives"
      }
    ],
