        "@value": "After 33 years it’s a retirement party for MOTUS O, the much-cherished dance-theatre company renowned for combining athletic choreography, innovative staging, and wacky humour in their family-friendly repertoire. Their final show offers a fascinating glimpse into the world of dance."
