    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Sarah Wegelin is a creative expressive artist based in Golden, B.C. Subtitled An Abstract Art Experience, JOY is Sarah's first exhibit in AGOG    Sarah writes:      Through abstract acrylic flow painting I work with the paint to help it become what it wants to be. As a facilitator of flow art,  it’s all about the process and the relationship I enjoy with colour and movement. I am one of many creators. I am motivated by the joy and wonder I feel from the experience.      In this exhibit and in celebration of the community of creators we all are, I am inviting participants to discover and experience the art shown through their own eyes, and through taking photos of the art with your phone. Through the ‘information’ button on your phone, you will be directed to art images online; this will engage you to discover works by other artists, further enhancing your art experience and engaging you in a world of discovery through abstract art.    Sarah Wegelin is a creative expressive artist based in Golden, B.C.    "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "AGOG presents Sarah Wegelin &#8220;Joy&#8221;"
      }
