    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Our Annual General Meeting will be held in person at the Civic Centre. Please gather around 5pm; the meeting will start promptly at 5:15pm MTN time. This AGM reviews our June 2021 through May 31, 2022 fiscal year.    June 2021 / May 2022 AGM Agenda Nov 22/2022: GDAC-KHC 2022-11-22 AGM Meeting Agenda    June 2021 / May 2022 GDAC Financials: GDAC-KHC-Cox-Financial Statements 2021-2022-Final    June 2020 / May 2021 AGM Minutes Nov 17/2021: GDAC-KHC AGM Minutes Nov 17-2021    June 2020 / May 2021 AGM Chair's Annual Report: AGM Chairs Report 21-22 Fiscal - Nov 22-2022    June 2020 / May 2021 Annual Report of Programs &amp; Operations: https://vimeo.com/774357047    Passionate about governance and leadership? Consider joining the KHC Board of Directors.  Learn more here: KHC Board Recruitment Info 11-2022        June 2021 / May 2022 - Nov 22/2022 AGM MEETING MINUTES: 2022-11-22 AGM Meeting Minutes-FINAL    Thanks,  Kalika Bowlby (Chair), Merryl Edington-Hyrb; Dustin Thomson; Lyuba Kirkova."
      }
