        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "This movie-making industry satire is witty, intelligent and saved from potentially unbearable navel-gazing by the warmth, talent and sheer charismatic chemistry of Cruz and Banderas. It’s comedy with an edge, a more than satisfying ending and a haunting final image."
