        "@value": "Being a member of a semi-rural community, I experience the impacts of living in a kind of cultural isolation, not just from larger centers, but also from my neighbouring towns. My goal was to visit other communities to paint, to listen, to learn about what makes us unique, and what binds us together. In This Together is an attempt to create a body of work that explores a new iconography—a visual vocabulary—of what ties us together as Canadian Columbia River Basin residents."
