        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "AGOG presents \"Financial Troubles\" Damian John | Kicking Horse Culture"
      }
    ],
    "https://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Money is something modern humans use to denote value. The unspoken contract between modern humans is that this variety of bills can be used in exchange for almost anything, the different colours, numbers and faces on the bills telling us their value. It is arguably the most important set of symbols, the most important idea, the most important contract we have created as modern humans."
      }
    ],
