    "https://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "John Wort Hannam played a house concert here a few years back now and the packed crowd hooted and hollered as John and his very tight band brought joy to us all with his memorable songs, some spiffy playing, and a sly sense of humour. Perfect to chase away the Covid blues."
      }
