        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Sir | Kicking Horse Culture"
      }
    ],
    "https://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Sir is ostensibly a Mumbai-set romance about the sparks that fly between a servant and her well-to-do employer. But if you take away the slow-brewing attraction that serves as an appealing logline, you still have a mighty fine picture about a village girl who wants to defy the patriarchy and stand on her own two feet in the city. Now Magazine"
      }
    ],
