        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Vancouver’s multiple award-winning Krystle Dos Santos is an electrifying soul, R&amp;B, and jazz singer whose power, versatility and onstage charisma are reminiscent of icons like Sharon Jones and Charles Bradley.    Walk, bike or drive to the park, but remember to be kind to our Selkirk Hill neighbours when coming and going through the neighbourhood.⁣"
