    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The meeting will be held in person at the Civic Centre. Vaccine passport is not mandatory. To attend via Zoom please send an email to info@kickinghorseculture.ca  with AGM in the subject to register. We will confirm and send you the meeting link with instructions on how to attend. Please gather around 5pm; the meeting will start promptly at 5:15pm MTN time.    June 2019 / May 2020 Nov 10/20AGM Minutes: GDAC:KHC Nov 10 2020 MINUTES for ANNUAL GENERAL MEETING-Final    June 2020 / May 2021 AGM Agenda Nov 17/21:  GDAC-KHC AGM Agenda Nov 17-2021    June 2020 / May 2021 GDAC Financials:  GDAC:KHC 2020-2021 Signed - Cox Financials-Sept_2021    KHC 20/21 AGM Board Report - Kalika Bowlby, Chair: KHC 20:21 AGM Board Report    KHC 20-21 AGM Annual Report Nov 17-2020: KHC 20-21 AGM Annual Report Nov 17-2020    Thanks,  Kalika Bowlby (Chair), Merryl Edington-Hyrb; Elva Mertick; Dustin Thomson; Lyuba Kirkova.    Passionate about governance and leadership? Consider joining the KHC Board of Directors. Learn more here: KHC Board Recruitment Info"
      }
    ],
