        "@value": "After a decade of dedicated “clowning around,” the three Myrtle Sisters have perfected an entertaining, family-friendly synthesis of comedy, vaudeville, tap dancing, and music. Their Out of Time, a tale of time-travel gone awry, is a memorable cavalcade of old-fashioned songs, charming goofiness, and inspired family antics.    An all-ages family show with an earlier start time. Doors at 6:30pm."
