        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "From trippy electronica to rural blues and acoustic funk, this talented duo has forged a unique, beguiling sound that’s made them audience favourites at major festivals like Rainbow Serpent and Shambhala.  ⁣⁣  Walk, bike or drive to the park, but remember to be kind to our Selkirk Hill neighbours when coming and going through the neighbourhood.⁣"
      }
    ],
