        "@value": "KHC presents: Local's Night | Kicking Horse Culture"
      }
    ],
    "https://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Local's Day kicks off our Summer Kicks series this year! With a line-up of entirely local musical acts, this event celebrates the talent we have here in our very own community. Grab your picnic blanket, your lawn chair, a sun hat, and come and boogie at Keith King Park!"
      }
    ],
